{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>And he said: Fix your wages.</b> etc. It refers to above — that is, 'If now I have found favor in your eyes' — since I know that I was blessed on your account — <b>Fix your wages upon me</b>, etc. And the fact that it writes <b>ויאמר: נקבה שכרך</b> (and he said: Fix your wages) — because matters intervened in between, it returned to say <b>ויאמר</b>. Such duplication of language occurs many times in Scripture."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:06:46.977421637Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}